<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">

<%- include('partials/head') %>

<body class="semillas-page" style="background-color: #faf7f2;">

    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <main class="main">

        <!-- Page Title Banner -->
        <div class="page-title accent-background" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4a154b 0%, #6b21a8 50%, #2e7d32 100%); padding: 130px 0 60px 0;">
            <div class="container d-lg-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
                <div data-aos="fade-right">
                    <span class="badge mb-2 px-3 py-2 text-uppercase" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); backdrop-filter: blur(5px); font-size: 0.85rem; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #fff; border-radius: 20px;">
                        🌱 Ministerio Infantil • By Elva Avila
                    </span>
                    <h1 class="mb-2 text-white fw-bold" style="font-size: 2.6rem;">Semillas de Torah</h1>
                    <p class="text-white-50 mb-0" style="font-size: 1.15rem;">Sembrando la Palabra, cosechando vida 💚</p>
                </div>
                <nav class="breadcrumbs mt-3 mt-lg-0" data-aos="fade-left">
                    <ol class="d-flex list-unstyled gap-2 m-0 p-0 text-white-50">
                        <li><a href="/" class="text-white text-decoration-none">Inicio</a></li>
                        <li class="text-white-50">/</li>
                        <li class="current text-white fw-semibold">Semillas de Torah</li>
                    </ol>
                </nav>
            </div>
        </div><!-- End Page Title -->

        <!-- Hero Section with Official Banner -->
        <section class="section py-5 position-relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="row align-items-center gy-5">
                    <div class="col-lg-6" data-aos="fade-right">
                        <div class="pe-lg-4">
                            <div class="d-inline-flex align-items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 mb-3 rounded-pill" style="background: #f3e8ff; color: #6b21a8; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.88rem; border: 1px solid #e9d5ff;">
                                <i class="bi bi-balloon-heart-fill text-danger"></i> Por Elva Avila
                            </div>
                            <h2 class="display-6 fw-bold mb-3" style="color: #2e1065; line-height: 1.3;">
                                Sembrando la Palabra en el corazón de las <span style="color: #6b21a8; border-bottom: 3px solid #22c55e;">nuevas generaciones</span>
                            </h2>
                            <p class="lead text-muted mb-4" style="font-size: 1.12rem; line-height: 1.8;">
                                <strong>Semillas de Torah</strong> es un espacio creado para que los niños y familias conozcan las riquezas de la Toráh, los valores bíblicos y las fiestas del Creador de una manera alegre, visual y pedagógica. <em>¡Abba sea glorificado!</em>
                            </p>

                            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-4">
                                <a href="https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61592294939779" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-lg px-4 py-3 shadow-sm rounded-pill fw-bold text-white d-inline-flex align-items-center gap-2" style="background: #1877F2; border: none; transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;">
                                    <i class="bi bi-facebook fs-5"></i> Seguir en Facebook Oficial
                                </a>
                                <a href="#actividades-seccion" class="btn btn-lg px-4 py-3 rounded-pill fw-bold d-inline-flex align-items-center gap-2" style="background: #ffffff; border: 2px solid #6b21a8; color: #6b21a8; transition: all 0.3s ease;">
                                    <i class="bi bi-camera-reels me-1"></i> Ver Novedades & Shorts (<%= (typeof shorts !== 'undefined' && shorts) ? shorts.length : 0 %>)
                                </a>
                            </div>

                            <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-top d-flex align-items-center gap-4 text-muted small">
                                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                                    <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-success fs-5"></i>
                                    <span>Aliyot con Niños</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                                    <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-success fs-5"></i>
                                    <span>Material Didáctico</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                                    <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-success fs-5"></i>
                                    <span>100% Gratuito</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-lg-6 text-center" data-aos="fade-left">
                        <div class="position-relative d-inline-block">
                            <!-- Official Banner Card -->
                            <div class="card border-0 shadow-lg" style="border-radius: 24px; overflow: hidden; background: #6b21a8; border: 4px solid #fff;">
                                <img src="/assets/img/pagina/semillas_torah_banner.png" alt="Semillas de Torah - Banner Oficial con Elva Avila" class="img-fluid w-100" style="object-fit: cover; max-height: 440px;">
                                <div class="p-3 text-center" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #581c87, #3b0764); color: #fff;">
                                    <p class="mb-0 fw-semibold" style="font-size: 0.95rem;">
                                        🌱 <em>"Instruye al niño en su camino, y aun cuando fuere viejo no se apartará de él."</em> — Proverbios 22:6
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- SECCIÓN PRINCIPAL CON PESTAÑAS: SHORTS / ENSEÑANZAS / ALIYOT -->
        <section id="actividades-seccion" class="section py-5" style="background-color: #ffffff;">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-md-row justify-content-between align-items-center mb-4 pb-3 border-bottom" data-aos="fade-up">
                    <div>
                        <span class="badge px-3 py-2 rounded-pill text-uppercase mb-2" style="background: #f3e8ff; color: #6b21a8; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 1px;">
                            Contenido & Recursos
                        </span>
                        <h2 class="fw-bold mb-1" style="color: #2e1065;">Novedades y Enseñanzas Infantiles</h2>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0">Videos de Aliyot con los niños en formato Shorts, historias y recursos para toda la familia.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Pestañas de Navegación -->
                <ul class="nav nav-pills gap-2 mb-4 flex-wrap" id="semillasTabs" role="tablist" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
                    <!-- Tab 1: Shorts / Novedades -->
                    <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
                        <button class="nav-link active px-4 py-3 fw-bold d-flex align-items-center gap-2 shadow-sm semillas-tab-btn" 
                                id="tab-shorts" data-bs-toggle="pill" data-bs-target="#pane-shorts" type="button" role="tab"
                                style="border-radius: 16px; border: 2px solid #bae6fd; font-size: 1rem; transition: all 0.3s ease;">
                            <i class="bi bi-camera-reels-fill fs-5 text-info"></i> 
                            Aliyot con Niños · Shorts
                            <span class="badge rounded-pill" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0284c7, #0369a1); color: #fff; font-size: 0.75rem;">
                                <%= (typeof shorts !== 'undefined' && shorts) ? shorts.length : 0 %> ✨ Novedad
                            </span>
                        </button>
                    </li>
                    <!-- Tab 2: Enseñanzas Infantiles -->
                    <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
                        <button class="nav-link px-4 py-3 fw-bold d-flex align-items-center gap-2 shadow-sm semillas-tab-btn" 
                                id="tab-ensenanzas" data-bs-toggle="pill" data-bs-target="#pane-ensenanzas" type="button" role="tab"
                                style="border-radius: 16px; border: 2px solid #e9d5ff; font-size: 1rem; transition: all 0.3s ease;">
                            <i class="bi bi-collection-play fs-5"></i> 
                            Enseñanzas Infantiles
                            <span class="badge rounded-pill" style="background: rgba(107,33,168,0.15); color: #6b21a8; font-size: 0.75rem;">
                                <%= (typeof items !== 'undefined' && items) ? items.length : 0 %>
                            </span>
                        </button>
                    </li>

                </ul>

                <div class="tab-content" id="semillasTabContent">

                    <!-- ============================================== -->
                    <!-- PESTAÑA 1: ALIYOT CON NIÑOS · SHORTS / NOVEDADES -->
                    <!-- ============================================== -->
                    <div class="tab-pane fade show active" id="pane-shorts" role="tabpanel">
                        
                        <!-- Banner Explicativo Novedades -->
                        <div class="p-4 mb-4 rounded-4 shadow-sm border-0 d-flex align-items-start gap-3" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f0f9ff 0%, #e0f2fe 50%, #f5f3ff 100%); border-left: 5px solid #0284c7 !important;">
                            <div class="rounded-circle p-2 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center flex-shrink-0" style="background: rgba(2,132,199,0.15); width: 50px; height: 50px; color: #0284c7;">
                                <i class="bi bi-camera-reels-fill fs-4"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex-grow-1">
                                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 flex-wrap mb-1">
                                    <h5 class="fw-bold mb-0" style="color: #0369a1;">Aliyot con los Niños · Novedades en Formato Shorts</h5>
                                    <span class="badge bg-danger rounded-pill px-2 py-1 small"><i class="bi bi-play-circle-fill me-1"></i>Videos Verticales</span>
                                </div>
                                <p class="mb-0 text-muted" style="font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6;">
                                    ¡Nuestros pequeños se deleitan en la Palabra! Aquí compartimos videos cortos donde los niños participan en la recitación, lectura y bendición de las <strong>Aliyot semanales</strong>. Haz clic en cualquiera para ver el video completo en pantalla completa interactiva.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Grid de Shorts Verticales (9:16 Aspect Ratio) -->
                        <div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-sm-2 row-cols-md-3 row-cols-lg-4 g-4 mb-4">
                            <% if (typeof shorts !== 'undefined' && shorts && shorts.length > 0) { %>
                                <% shorts.forEach((short, idx) => { %>
                                    <div class="col" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="<%= (idx % 4 + 1) * 80 %>">
                                        <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm rounded-4 overflow-hidden short-card position-relative h-100" 
                                             onclick="openShortModal(<%= idx %>)" 
                                             style="cursor: pointer; background: #000; border: 2px solid transparent; transition: all 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1); aspect-ratio: 9 / 16; max-height: 480px;">
                                            
                                            <!-- Poster / Image -->
                                            <img src="<%= short.thumbnail_url || '/assets/img/pagina/semillas_torah_banner.png' %>" 
                                                 alt="<%= short.title %>" 
                                                 class="short-thumb w-100 h-100" 
                                                 style="object-fit: cover; transition: transform 0.5s ease;">

                                            <!-- Gradient Overlay -->
                                            <div class="position-absolute top-0 start-0 w-100 h-100 short-overlay" 
                                                 style="background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.5) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.1) 40%, rgba(0,0,0,0.88) 100%); pointer-events: none;">
                                            </div>

                                            <!-- Top Badges -->
                                            <div class="position-absolute top-0 start-0 w-100 p-3 d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center z-2">
                                                <div class="d-flex gap-1 flex-wrap">
                                                    <% if (short.is_highlight) { %>
                                                        <span class="badge rounded-pill px-2 py-1 shadow-sm" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b, #d97706); font-size: 0.72rem; color: #fff;">
                                                            <i class="bi bi-star-fill me-1"></i> Destacado
                                                        </span>
                                                    <% } else { %>
                                                        <span class="badge rounded-pill px-2 py-1 shadow-sm" style="background: rgba(2,132,199,0.85); backdrop-filter: blur(4px); font-size: 0.72rem; color: #fff;">
                                                            <i class="bi bi-camera-reels me-1"></i> Short
                                                        </span>
                                                    <% } %>
                                                    <% if (short.aliyah_number) { %>
                                                        <span class="badge bg-success bg-opacity-90 rounded-pill px-2 py-1 shadow-sm" style="font-size: 0.72rem;">
                                                            <%= short.aliyah_number %>ª Aliyá
                                                        </span>
                                                    <% } %>
                                                </div>
                                                <% if (short.video_url || short.youtube_short_url) { %>
                                                    <span class="badge bg-dark bg-opacity-75 rounded-circle p-2 shadow-sm text-white" title="Video disponible">
                                                        <i class="bi bi-play-fill fs-6"></i>
                                                    </span>
                                                <% } %>
                                            </div>

                                            <!-- Center Play Icon (Revealed on hover) -->
                                            <div class="position-absolute top-50 start-50 translate-middle play-btn-overlay z-2 text-center" style="transition: all 0.3s ease;">
                                                <div class="rounded-circle d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center shadow-lg" 
                                                     style="width: 58px; height: 58px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.92); color: #6b21a8; font-size: 1.6rem; backdrop-filter: blur(4px); transition: transform 0.3s ease;">
                                                    <i class="bi bi-play-fill ms-1"></i>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>

                                            <!-- Bottom Info -->
                                            <div class="position-absolute bottom-0 start-0 w-100 p-3 z-2 text-white">
                                                <% if (short.parasha_name) { %>
                                                    <div class="d-inline-flex align-items-center gap-1 px-2 py-1 mb-2 rounded-pill shadow-sm" style="background: rgba(107,33,168,0.85); backdrop-filter: blur(4px); font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 600;">
                                                        <i class="bi bi-journal-bookmark"></i> <%= short.parasha_name %>
                                                    </div>
                                                <% } %>

                                                <h6 class="fw-bold mb-1 text-white text-truncate-2" style="font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.35; text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);">
                                                    <%= short.title %>
                                                </h6>

                                                <% if (short.child_name) { %>
                                                    <div class="small d-flex align-items-center gap-1 text-info fw-semibold mb-1" style="font-size: 0.82rem; text-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);">
                                                        <i class="bi bi-person-heart text-danger"></i> <%= short.child_name %>
                                                    </div>
                                                <% } %>

                                                <% if (short.verses_reference) { %>
                                                    <div class="text-white-50 small text-truncate" style="font-size: 0.75rem;">
                                                        <i class="bi bi-book me-1"></i> <%= short.verses_reference %>
                                                    </div>
                                                <% } %>
                                            </div>

                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                <% }) %>
                            <% } else { %>
                                <div class="col-12 text-center py-5">
                                    <div class="d-inline-flex p-4 rounded-circle mb-3" style="background: #e0f2fe; color: #0284c7; font-size: 3rem;">
                                        <i class="bi bi-camera-reels"></i>
                                    </div>
                                    <h4 class="fw-bold" style="color: #0369a1;">Próximamente videos de Aliyot con los Niños</h4>
                                    <p class="text-muted">Estamos grabando las lecturas y bendiciones de las porciones con los pequeños para compartirlas aquí.</p>
                                </div>
                            <% } %>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- ======================= -->
                    <!-- PESTAÑA 2: ENSEÑANZAS   -->
                    <!-- ======================= -->
                    <div class="tab-pane fade" id="pane-ensenanzas" role="tabpanel">
                        <div class="row g-4">
                            <% if (typeof items !== 'undefined' && items && items.length > 0) { %>
                                <% items.forEach((item, index) => { %>
                                    <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="<%= (index % 3 + 1) * 100 %>">
                                        <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm rounded-4 overflow-hidden dynamic-semilla-card bg-white" style="transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease; border: 1px solid #f3e8ff;">
                                            
                                            <!-- Card Image & Badges -->
                                            <div class="position-relative" style="height: 220px; background: #2e1065; overflow: hidden;">
                                                <% if (item.image_url && item.image_url.trim() !== '') { %>
                                                    <img src="<%= item.image_url %>" alt="<%= item.title %>" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; transition: transform 0.4s ease;" class="card-img-top-hover">
                                                <% } else { %>
                                                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center h-100 w-100" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f3e8ff, #ede9fe);">
                                                        <i class="bi bi-balloon-heart text-purple" style="font-size: 4rem; color: #a855f7;"></i>
                                                    </div>
                                                <% } %>

                                                <!-- Category badge -->
                                                <span class="position-absolute top-0 start-0 m-3 badge px-3 py-1 shadow-sm" style="background: rgba(107, 33, 168, 0.9); backdrop-filter: blur(4px); font-size: 0.75rem; border-radius: 20px;">
                                                    <%= item.category || 'Parashá Infantil' %>
                                                </span>

                                                <!-- Video / PDF Badges -->
                                                <div class="position-absolute bottom-0 end-0 m-3 d-flex gap-1">
                                                    <% if (item.pdf_file) { %>
                                                        <span class="badge bg-success shadow-sm" title="Tiene PDF descargable"><i class="bi bi-file-pdf"></i> PDF</span>
                                                    <% } %>
                                                    <% if (item.video_file) { %>
                                                        <span class="badge bg-primary shadow-sm" title="Tiene Video / Aliyá Infantil"><i class="bi bi-camera-video"></i> Video</span>
                                                    <% } %>
                                                    <% if (item.youtube_link) { %>
                                                        <span class="badge bg-danger shadow-sm" title="Tiene Video de YouTube"><i class="bi bi-youtube"></i> YouTube</span>
                                                    <% } %>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>

                                            <!-- Card Body -->
                                            <div class="card-body p-4 d-flex flex-column">
                                                <% if (item.subtitle) { %>
                                                    <div class="text-uppercase fw-bold small mb-1" style="color: #6b21a8; font-size: 0.78rem; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">
                                                        <%= item.subtitle %>
                                                    </div>
                                                <% } %>
                                                
                                                <h4 class="fw-bold mb-2" style="font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.4;">
                                                    <a href="/semillas-de-torah/<%= item.id %>" class="text-decoration-none text-dark hover-purple">
                                                        <%= item.title %>
                                                    </a>
                                                </h4>

                                                <% if (item.description) { %>
                                                    <p class="text-muted mb-4 small" style="line-height: 1.6; display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 3; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; overflow: hidden;">
                                                        <%= item.description %>
                                                    </p>
                                                <% } %>

                                                <div class="mt-auto pt-3 border-top d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between">
                                                    <span class="small text-muted"><i class="bi bi-person me-1"></i><%= item.author || 'Elva Avila' %></span>
                                                    <a href="/semillas-de-torah/<%= item.id %>" class="btn btn-sm px-3 rounded-pill fw-bold text-white shadow-sm" style="background: #6b21a8;">
                                                        Ver Detalle <i class="bi bi-arrow-right ms-1"></i>
                                                    </a>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                <% }) %>
                            <% } else { %>
                                <div class="col-12 text-center py-5">
                                    <div class="d-inline-flex p-4 rounded-circle mb-3" style="background: #f3e8ff; color: #6b21a8; font-size: 3rem;">
                                        <i class="bi bi-balloon-heart"></i>
                                    </div>
                                    <h4 class="fw-bold" style="color: #2e1065;">Próximamente publicaremos lecciones infantiles</h4>
                                    <p class="text-muted">Estamos preparando historias, actividades para colorear y resúmenes de la Toráh para compartir aquí.</p>
                                    <a href="https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61592294939779" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary rounded-pill px-4" style="background: #1877F2; border: none;">
                                        <i class="bi bi-facebook me-1"></i> Visitar Facebook Oficial
                                    </a>
                                </div>
                            <% } %>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div><!-- End Tab Content -->

            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Presentación de la Coordinadora / Acerca de -->
        <section class="section py-5" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fdfbf7 0%, #f5efe6 100%);">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="row align-items-center gy-4 p-4 p-md-5 bg-white rounded-4 shadow-sm" style="border: 2px solid #f3e8ff;">
                    <div class="col-md-4 text-center" data-aos="zoom-in">
                        <div style="width: 220px; height: 220px; margin: 0 auto; border-radius: 50%; padding: 6px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6b21a8, #22c55e); box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(107,33,168,0.25);">
                            <img src="/assets/img/pagina/semillas_torah_logo.png" alt="Logo Oficial Semillas de Torah" class="img-fluid w-100 h-100 rounded-circle" style="object-fit: cover;">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-8" data-aos="fade-left">
                        <span class="badge px-3 py-2 rounded-pill text-uppercase mb-2" style="background: #e8f5e9; color: #2e7d32; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.8rem;">
                            Enseñanza y Edificación
                        </span>
                        <h3 class="fw-bold mb-3" style="color: #2e1065;">Sobre Semillas de Torah</h3>
                        <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8;">
                            Coordinado por <strong>Elva Avila</strong>, este ministerio tiene como propósito sembrar en los corazones infantiles el amor por las Escrituras, la identidad en el Creador y la belleza de caminar en obediencia a Su Toráh, mediante narraciones amenas, recursos interactivos y actividades familiares.
                        </p>
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mt-4">
                            <a href="https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61592294939779" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-outline-primary rounded-pill px-4 py-2 fw-semibold" style="border-color: #1877F2; color: #1877F2;">
                                <i class="bi bi-facebook me-1"></i> Ver perfil en Facebook
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Pilares de Aprendizaje -->
        <section class="section py-5" style="background-color: #ffffff;">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="text-center max-w-700 mx-auto mb-5" data-aos="fade-up">
                    <span class="badge px-3 py-2 rounded-pill text-uppercase" style="background: #f3e8ff; color: #6b21a8; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 1px;">
                        ¿Qué aprendemos?
                    </span>
                    <h2 class="fw-bold mt-2" style="color: #2e1065;">Pilares de Nuestra Enseñanza</h2>
                    <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: 1.05rem;">Cada lección y dinámica está orientada a nutrir espiritualmente a los pequeños.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="row g-4">
                    <!-- Pilar 1 -->
                    <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
                        <div class="card h-100 border-0 p-4 shadow-sm feature-card" style="border-radius: 20px; background: #faf5ff; border-top: 5px solid #6b21a8 !important;">
                            <div class="icon-box mb-3 d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center" style="width: 60px; height: 60px; border-radius: 16px; background: #ede9fe; color: #6b21a8; font-size: 1.8rem;">
                                <i class="bi bi-journal-bookmark-fill"></i>
                            </div>
                            <h4 class="fw-bold mb-2" style="color: #2e1065;">Parashá Semanal Infantil</h4>
